  CVE-2025-47405|2026-05-04T17:16:20.827|2026-05-05T19:32:23.613|7.8|HIGH|CWE-822|N/A|false|Memory corruption when processing camera sensor input/output control codes with invalid output buffers.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-47405|0.00015|0.03244|5.4604
